WEBVTT

NOTE Tacet product film — generated by design/film/render.mjs from design/film/voiceover.txt

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.300
Sabine has processed invoices for
twenty-four years.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.260
She retires Friday. The written process
covers half.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.480
Mira writes its guess before she decides.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.440
Sabine: Capex. Zero four hundred.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:21.290
It can't explain that. So it waits for a
pause, and asks one question.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.090
Mira: You coded it 0400. What made you do
that?

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.000
Sabine: Equipment over five thousand net
is always capex.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.170
Her answer becomes a rule. Before, four
seven one one. Now, zero four hundred.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.100
Words aren't proof.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:44.474
So Mira answers unseen invoices,
committing to each one with a hash before

00:00:44.474 --> 00:00:45.200
any label.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.434
Each answer is checked against what it
committed to — and every label also

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.000
teaches.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.650
Eleven fresh invoices. Eleven right.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.300
Monday. A new hire follows the 2019 doc.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.900
Mira: Sabine would stop here.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.580
Her rule, in her words, before the mistake
happens.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.620
A Work Map she can sign. Exportable to any
agent.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.410
It learns the part of the job nobody wrote
down.
